==Battleground==
*2 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*2 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns.

==Strategy==
You should focus on depleting all the other enemies in this level first before trying to fight with Princess Punt. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pole Vaulter]] works well here in taking out the Zombie enemies. After you're done with the enemies, you can kill Princess Punt easily.

